  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Here is an idea I cooked up that I think a lot of fellow roleplayers would like!\n\nEssentially, instead of relying on your display name, there could be an option for character names, so you can easily switch between them when roleplaying!\n\nAdditionally, it's most prominent on your nametag, so people are more likely to refer to you by the character you're playing as, rather than your display name.\n\nReddit post: https://www.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/1uq6rb9/character_naming_system/",
